<title>SWEDEN: Ericsson rises amid rumours of upgrade.</title>
<headline>Ericsson rises amid rumours of upgrade.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish telecoms group Ericsson rose on Wednesday morning in lively trade with brokers saying there were market rumours of an upgrade from SmithBarney.</p>
<p>Ericsson shares were 10.5 crowns higher at 302 at 1000 GMT.</p>
<p>&quot;There are rumours of an upgrade from SmithBarney that says the share should be priced at $55,&quot; one broker said.</p>
<p>-- Joel Dahlberg, Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700 1007</p>
